  Arduino IoT Cloud Variables description

  CloudElectricCurrent Corrente;
  CloudElectricPotential Tensao;
  float FdP;
  float Frequencia;
  float THD;

  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  RECEPTOR LoRa (ESP32 B) + ARDUINO CLOUD
  Recebe os pacotes do transmissor via LoRa, mostra no Monitor Serial
  e publica no Cloud:
     Corrente   <- irms (A)
     Tensao     <- vrms (V)
     FdP        <- fator de potencia
     Frequencia <- frequencia (Hz)
     THD        <- THD de tensao (%)

  Modulo LoRa RFM95W (alimentar SOMENTE com 3,3 V):
     VCC->3V3 | GND->GND | SCK->18 | MISO->19 | MOSI->23
     NSS->5   | RESET->14 | DIO0->26
  Biblioteca: LoRa (Sandeep Mistry)
